{"type": "message", "id": "ad99d18e", "parentId": "c7e440cc", "timestamp": "2026-07-17T08:28:11.167Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_10c3b5e9a7344890addb51b2", "toolName": "image", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "This radar chart, titled **“Model Comparison on L-1 Dimensions”**, visually compares the performance of two AI models — **Qwen3-VL-A22B** (blue) and **Gemini-2.5-Pro** (red) — across four dimensions labeled **Dim1, Dim2, Dim3, and Dim4**.\n\n---\n\n### Key Features:\n\n- **Axes**: The chart has four radial axes corresponding to the four dimensions (Dim1 to Dim4), arranged clockwise starting from the right.\n- **Scale**: Concentric circles represent score levels: 0 (center), 20, 40, 60, 80, and 100 (outermost ring).\n- **Data Representation**: Each model’s scores are plotted as points along each axis and connected to form a polygon. The area filled under each polygon is shaded (light blue for Qwen3-VL-A22B, light red for Gemini-2.5-Pro).\n\n---\n\n### Performance Breakdown by Dimension:\n\n#### ➤ **Dim1 (Right axis)**:\n- **Qwen3-VL-A22B**: ~75\n- **Gemini-2.5-Pro**: ~35  \n→ *Qwen significantly outperforms Gemini here.*\n\n#### ➤ **Dim2 (Top axis)**:\n- **Qwen3-VL-A22B**: ~50\n- **Gemini-2.5-Pro**: ~30  \n→ *Qwen again leads, though both are moderate.*\n\n#### ➤ **Dim3 (Left axis)**:\n- **Qwen3-VL-A22B**: ~55\n- **Gemini-2.5-Pro**: ~10  \n→ *Largest gap between models; Qwen dominates.*\n\n#### ➤ **Dim4 (Bottom axis)**:\n- **Qwen3-VL-A22B**: ~5\n- **Gemini-2.5-Pro**: ~10  \n→ *Only dimension where Gemini slightly outperforms Qwen, though both scores are very low.*\n\n---\n\n### Overall Observations:\n\n- **Qwen3-VL-A22B** consistently outperforms **Gemini-2.5-Pro** in three out of four dimensions (Dim1, Dim2, Dim3), with particularly strong advantages in Dim1 and Dim3.\n- **Gemini-2.5-Pro** only edges out Qwen in Dim4, but even there, both models perform poorly (<15).\n- The **area covered by Qwen’s polygon** is substantially larger than Gemini’s, indicating superior overall performance across the evaluated dimensions.\n- Both models show weakness in **Dim4**, suggesting this may be a challenging or less optimized dimension for both architectures.\n\n---\n\n### Conclusion:\n\nThe radar chart clearly illustrates that **Qwen3-VL-A22B outperforms Gemini-2.5-Pro** across most evaluated dimensions, especially in Dim1 and Dim3. Gemini shows a slight advantage only in Dim4, which appears to be a low-scoring dimension for both models. This suggests Qwen3-VL-A22B is more balanced and capable across the tested criteria.\n\n*(Note: “L-1 Dimensions” likely refers to a specific benchmark or evaluation framework — possibly related to vision-language tasks — though the exact meaning of “L-1” isn’t specified in the chart.)*"}], "details": {"model": "openai/qwen35-397b-claw-normal", "image": "/app/working/workspaces/default/output/comparison_radar.png", "attempts": []}, "isError": false, "timestamp": 1784276891165}}
